5. Map data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Map tiles rendered by the dispatch console default to the OpenStreetMap
  Foundation's public tile server.

  OpenStreetMap data is (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed under the
  Open Database Licence (ODbL) 1.0. https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  ATTRIBUTION IS A LICENCE CONDITION. Both map renderers in the dispatch
  console display it; do not remove it.

  The OSMF tile server runs on donated infrastructure and its Tile Usage
  Policy asks that redistributed products not rely on it as a bulk default.
  If you deploy PushComm for a real fleet, set VITE_MAP_TILE_URL (and
  VITE_MAP_TILE_ATTRIBUTION to match) to your own tile server or a commercial
  provider at build time.
  https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/tiles/

