6. Not present in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  The commercial PushComm add-ons are not part of Community Edition, and
  neither are their dependencies. In particular this repository contains no
  Whisper (transcription), no Valhalla (snap-to-road telematics) and no TomTom
  (live traffic) code, configuration or credentials.
